              <p>Let’s get rid of that old yee-yee roblox menu. The new one hasn’t changed much except add some transparency effects, and some stuff is still unaligned such as the top-left bar that I also remade.</p>
<p>Have a new taste of what I finished in just 3 hours.<br>
I don’t know what to think of it, but I decided to do it for fun. Some icons may not make sense cause I couldn’t find corresponding ones.</p>
<p>Program used: Figma<br>
Font: Gotham SSM<br>
Icons: SF Symbols 5</p>
